---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../consts';

---

<BaseLayout
  title="Independent Insurance Advisor Nashville, TN | Coverage Review"
  description="Independent insurance advisor serving Nashville, TN. We review home, auto, life, Medicare, and small business coverage — so you know exactly where you stand."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative text-white py-15 md:py-21 overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Video background -->
    <video
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
      autoplay
      loop
      muted
      playsinline
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <source src="/hero-compressed.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <!-- Base dark overlay (light, keeps skyline visible) -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-navy-900" style="opacity: 0.32;"></div>
    <!-- Left gradient overlay (darkens the text area only) -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(15,32,68,0.75) 0%, rgba(15,32,68,0.4) 50%, transparent 100%);"></div>
    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-gold-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Independent Insurance Advisory · Nashville, TN</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-bold leading-tight mb-6 text-white" style="text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);">
          We don't shop rates.<br />We review lives.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-navy-200 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl" style="text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);">
          Every other agent starts with a quote. We start with questions. {BRAND.name} is an independent advisory firm that reviews your full coverage picture before recommending anything.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="/contact?path=urgent"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-navy-900 font-semibold text-lg rounded-lg transition-colors"
          >
            I Need Coverage Now
          </a>
          <a
            href="/contact?path=review"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border-2 border-gold-500 text-gold-400 hover:bg-gold-500 hover:text-navy-900 font-medium text-lg rounded-lg transition-colors"
          >
            I Want a Full Review
          </a>
          <a
            href="#how-it-works"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-medium text-white underline hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors"
            style="text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);"
          >
            How It Works
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-navy-400 text-sm mt-6" style="text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);">Nashville metro · By appointment only · No walk-ins</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust Bar -->
  <section class="bg-navy-800 text-white py-6">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 text-sm text-navy-200">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold-500 inline-block"></span>
          Licensed in Tennessee
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold-500 inline-block"></span>
          Property &amp; Casualty
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold-500 inline-block"></span>
          Independent — Not Captive
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold-500 inline-block"></span>
          Nashville Metro, By Appointment
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Independent Matters -->
  <section class="py-15 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">
          Why Independent Matters for Nashville Families
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Most agents work for one company and have a quota to hit. We work for you. That changes everything about the conversation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-navy-100 mb-5 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-navy-900 font-serif font-bold text-lg">✓</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3">We Listen Before We Recommend</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">A good doctor listens, runs the tests, and figures out what's actually wrong before they prescribe anything. Most insurance agents skip that part — they're trying to hit a number or move a product. We don't have a product to push. We have a process: understand your situation first, recommend coverage second.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-navy-100 mb-5 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-navy-900 font-serif font-bold text-lg">✓</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3">Cheap Quotes Don't Mean Much</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Anyone can shop you a low rate. But what good is a low quote if you don't actually know what you're buying? We've seen too many people with cheap policies that didn't cover the thing they thought it did — like a dishwasher leak that gets denied because of a seepage clause they never knew existed. Independent means we explain it. Not just sell it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-navy-100 mb-5 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-navy-900 font-serif font-bold text-lg">✓</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3">Your Coverage Should Grow With You</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">New home. New business. Kids, friends' kids on your trampoline, a pool in the backyard, a teenager driving the family car. Your life keeps changing, and your insurance needs to keep up. We stay in the loop — adjusting your carriers and policies as your life evolves — instead of binding a policy and disappearing until renewal.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Overview -->
  <section class="py-15" style="background-color: #f0f4fa;">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">Insurance Coverage We Review in Nashville</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Most people have insurance. Most people don't actually understand what it does. We review every line — together — so you know exactly what's covered, where the gaps are, and what needs to change.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">

        <!-- Home & Auto -->
        <a href="/services/home-auto" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-navy-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color: #e8edf5;">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-navy-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/>
              <path d="M9 22V12h6v10"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Home &amp; Auto</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">Your house, your cars, your stuff. Most homeowner policies have exclusions buried in them — water damage, jewelry, home offices, rental situations — that people don't find out about until they file a claim. We walk through your actual policy and show you what it covers and, more importantly, what it doesn't.</p>
          <span class="text-gold-600 text-sm font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Learn more
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <!-- Small Business -->
        <a href="/services/small-business" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-navy-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color: #e8edf5;">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-navy-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Small Business</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">If you own a business, your personal policies probably don't protect it. General liability, workers' comp, commercial property, professional liability — we review what your business actually needs based on what you do, who works for you, and what could go wrong.</p>
          <span class="text-gold-600 text-sm font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Learn more
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <!-- Life Insurance -->
        <a href="/services/life-insurance" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-navy-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color: #e8edf5;">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-navy-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Life Insurance</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">Life insurance isn't about you — it's about who you'd leave behind. We review what you have, whether it still fits the life you're living now, and what needs to change. Term, whole, universal — we look across carriers and find the right fit.</p>
          <span class="text-gold-600 text-sm font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Learn more
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <!-- Retirement Income Planning -->
        <a href="/services/retirement-income" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-navy-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color: #e8edf5;">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-navy-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/>
              <polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Retirement Income Planning</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">Retirement isn't just about how much you've saved — it's about turning it into income you can't outlive. We help Nashville families build a plan for predictable, guaranteed retirement cash flow before the paycheck stops.</p>
          <span class="text-gold-600 text-sm font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Learn more
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <!-- Long-Term Care -->
        <a href="/services/long-term-care" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-navy-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color: #e8edf5;">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-navy-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Long-Term Care</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">70% of people over 65 will need long-term care. Medicare doesn't cover most of it. The cost can wipe out a retirement in a few years if you're not prepared. We plan for this before it becomes a crisis — when there are still good options on the table.</p>
          <span class="text-gold-600 text-sm font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Learn more
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <!-- Medicare -->
        <a href="/services/medicare" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-navy-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color: #e8edf5;">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-navy-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Medicare</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">Turning 65 in Nashville? Already on Medicare and not sure you picked the right plan? Medicare has more moving parts than most people realize — Parts A, B, C, D, supplements, drug coverage, networks. We review your situation every year because the right plan in 2026 might not be right in 2027.</p>
          <span class="text-gold-600 text-sm font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Learn more
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mid-page CTA Band -->
  <section id="midpage-cta" class="bg-navy-900 text-gold-50 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-gold-50">
          Not sure what you're missing?
        </h2>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-navy-900 font-semibold text-lg rounded-lg transition-colors"
          >
            Book a Coverage Check
          </a>
          <a
            href={`tel:${BRAND.phoneE164}`}
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border-2 border-gold-500 text-gold-400 hover:bg-gold-500 hover:text-navy-900 font-medium text-lg rounded-lg transition-colors"
          >
            Call {BRAND.phone}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process Teaser -->
  <section id="how-it-works" class="py-15 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-gold-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">How It Works</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-5">
            A Process, Not a Pitch
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            The Coverage Roadmap is a four-stage process: Coverage Check, Quote &amp; Bind, Coverage Roadmap Review, and Annual Life Review. If you have a deadline, we get you covered first and do the full review after. If you don't, we do the review first. Either way you end up with the whole picture.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/process"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-navy-900 font-semibold hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors"
          >
            See the full process
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900">Coverage Check</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Fifteen minutes. Bring your current declarations pages and we look at them together. Nothing to sign, no obligation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900">Quote &amp; Bind</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">If you need coverage in place, we place it. You don't have to sit through a full review to get protected.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900">Coverage Roadmap Review</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Thirty to forty-five days after you're covered. The full gap analysis across every line — home, auto, umbrella, life, long-term care, Medicare, retirement income. Included, nothing to buy.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900">Annual Life Review</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Every year, in the month you first came on board, we sit back down and review your full picture. Same advisor, every time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Teaser -->
  <section class="py-15 bg-navy-900 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <img
            src="/advisor-headshot.jpg"
            alt="Your independent insurance advisor — Nashville, TN"
            class="w-48 h-48 rounded-full object-cover border-4 mb-6"
            style="border-color: #c9a84c; object-position: 50% 5%;"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <p class="text-gold-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Your Advisor</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">Your Advisor</h2>
          <p class="text-navy-200 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A decade in financial planning — sitting across from Nashville families, walking them through their full picture until things actually made sense. Most people don't have a coverage problem, they have a clarity problem. Nobody's ever shown them how the pieces fit together.
          </p>
          <p class="text-navy-200 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            That's the whole point of {BRAND.name}. Not the cheapest quote. Not the fastest close. Just an honest look at where you are, where the gaps are, and what needs to be in place — so you can stop guessing and start feeling protected.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 font-semibold transition-colors"
          >
            Meet Your Advisor
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section id="closing-cta" class="py-15" style="background-color: #fdf8ee;">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">
        Ready to understand your coverage?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Schedule a coverage review. It starts with a conversation, not a sales pitch.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-navy-900 hover:bg-navy-800 text-white font-semibold text-lg rounded-lg transition-colors"
        >
          Book a Coverage Check
        </a>
        <a
          href={`tel:${BRAND.phoneE164}`}
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border border-navy-300 hover:border-navy-500 text-navy-900 font-medium text-lg rounded-lg transition-colors"
        >
          Call {BRAND.phone}
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
